window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A unique collection of brand new crime stories from some of the masters of crimewriting, and only available in this audio collection.</p> <p> Welcome to the <i>Sounds of Crime</i>, an exclusive collection of five brand new short stories by some of the best crimewriters around. Using the theme of 'audio', this unique collection features brand new stories by Lawrence Block, Peter James, Val McDermid, Mark Billingham and Christopher Fowler. By turns gripping, puzzling and sinister, the Sounds of Crime will chill your blood from the first spoken word to the last...</p>"; 
